<title>GREECE: ERGOBANK CUTS CONSUMER LOAN RATE APR 14.</title>
<headline>ERGOBANK CUTS CONSUMER LOAN RATE APR 14.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ergobank will cut its</p>
<p>consumer loan rate by 350 basis points, effective April 14, it</p>
<p>said on Friday.</p>
<p>It will offer the following rate structure:</p>
<p>    ** Savings deposit			 9.0  percent</p>
<p>    ** Base lending rate (prime)	  15.75</p>
<p>    ** Mortgage rate (floating)	   14.50</p>
<p>    ** Business loan for fixed assets   15.50</p>
<p>    ** House renovation loan		20.00</p>
<p>    ** Personal loan (up to 1.0 mln)    20.50</p>
<p>    ** Consumer loan with invoices	18.50</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
